#~ " entry point stays the shared "
#~ "`FixedRouter` until they are; see "
#~ "[#1457](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/issues/1457)."
#~ " Pins from the HTTP API and the"
#~ " admin playground keep using the "
#~ "shared `FixedRouter` regardless."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "它的亲和更新、首选 claim 被拒后的重新选路，以及回退时的熔断器判断时机，都还没有被证明与原 "
#~ "`Fixed` 循环等价；在证明之前，默认入口仍然是共享的 `FixedRouter`。见 "
#~ "[#1457](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/issues/1457)。来自"
#~ " HTTP API 和管理端 playground 的 pin "
#~ "无论如何都继续使用共享的 `FixedRouter`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Candidate scopes do not divide physical"
#~ " capacity. Each `RouteWiseRouter` still "
#~ "owns its resource managers; sharing a"
#~ " constrained pool across independent "
#~ "instances and rejecting unsupported "
#~ "duplicate-pool configurations remain deferred "
#~ "to the same issue."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "候选范围不会把物理容量分成独立的份额。每个 `RouteWiseRouter` 仍持有自己的资源 "
#~ "manager；跨独立实例共享受限池，以及拒绝不受支持的重复池配置，均由同一个 issue 跟踪后续实现。"

