#~ msgid ""
#~ "Aliases share the canonical model's "
#~ "router: `ModelRouterRegistry` resolves an "
#~ "alias to its canonical id before "
#~ "looking up or building anything, so "
#~ "a stateful router is never split "
#~ "across a model and its alias."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "别名与规范模型共用同一个 router：`ModelRouterRegistry` "
#~ "在查找或构建任何东西之前，先把别名解析成规范 id，因此一个有状态的 router "
